## Map

| Preferred | Ops | Runtime |
|-----------|-----|---------|
| HttpCap | fetch, http_get, net_get, … | require_http \| NetCap |
| TcpCap | tcp_connect/write/read/close, tls_connect | require_tcp \| NetCap |
| BindCap | tcp_bind | require_bind \| NetCap |
| UdpCap | bind_udp, udp_recv | require_udp \| NetCap |
| NetCap only | sock_raw, raw_socket | require_net |

